                  <p class="beat" style="--d: .5s; position: absolute; left: 6%; right: 6%; bottom: 20%; margin: 0; text-align: center; font-size: 11cqw; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 112%; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 0 1cqw 3cqw rgba(0,0,0,0.8)">Your video's <span style="color: #e3a53c">a mess.</span></p>
